and,

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:34.760
and really didn't impress people with,

00:01:34.769 --> 00:01:39.629
with what it showed you had this period of time where the stock was falling really rapidly.

00:01:39.639 --> 00:01:43.959
There was a sense that this bank was increasingly at risk of being seized 

00:01:46.099 --> 00:01:48.120
early in the morning of May 1st,

00:01:48.129 --> 00:01:52.900
an announcement came out that Jp Morgan would be buying First Republic Bank and this was a 

00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:57.809
deal that was orchestrated by the Federal deposit Insurance Corp when the F P IC conducts this process 

