it's basically looking for the best bid.

00:02:02.589 --> 00:02:03.529
And in the deal,

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:08.389
Jp Morgan will be taking on some $92 billion and deposits 

00:02:08.399 --> 00:02:12.240
from First Republic buying a lot of assets including the banks,

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:13.779
loans and bonds.

00:02:13.789 --> 00:02:15.660
Shareholders will get wiped out.

00:02:15.669 --> 00:02:20.550
This is a deal that will effectively allow First Republic to live on as a part 

00:02:20.559 --> 00:02:21.919
of JP Morgan.

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:26.259
Let me be very clear while depositors are being protected,

00:02:26.320 --> 00:02:31.220
shareholders are losing their investments and critically taxpayers are not the 

00:02:31.229 --> 00:02:32.389
